    44→| 私有字段 | _camelCase | `_currentHealth`, `_isJumping` |
    45→| 局部变量 | camelCase | `targetPosition`, `damageAmount` |
    46→| 常量 | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_PLAYERS`, `DEFAULT_SPEED` |
    47→| 静态只读 | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `Instance`, `DefaultSettings` |
    48→| 枚举 | ***Enum | `HeroQualityEnum`, `GameStateEnum` |
    49→| 事件 | PascalCase | `OnDeath`, `OnLevelComplete` |
    50→| 界面类 | ***View | `HeroListView`, `ShopView` |
